  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The novel names transformation path as a cultivation path whose Gu Masters change their bodies and whose founder is a Demon Venerable, not as a casual label for any shapeshift. Cheng Hu, a rank four Gu Master whose Cheng tribe was subjugated by Ma tribe, is named a cultivator of transformation path.",
      "chapters": [
        523
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "char_cheng_hu",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "fac_cheng_tribe",
        "fac_ma_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A transformation path Gu Master can change parts of the body into beast features, and the complete transformation is a killer move. The novel states a superiority of the path: every transformation path Gu Master possesses at least one killer move once they collect the respective Gu worms.",
      "chapters": [
        523
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reckless Savage Demon Venerable could transform into countless fierce beasts with an endless number of transformations, and could even revive from a drop of blood. An ordinary true inheritance from him holds the transformation path killer move primordial ash owl transformation, which lets a Gu Immortal become that beast and gain a huge boost in strength.",
      "chapters": [
        597
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_reckless_savage_demon_venerable",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reckless Savage Demon Venerable was the progenitor of strength path and also the creator of transformation path.",
      "chapters": [
        597
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reckless-savage-founder",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Li Shan later repeats the same founding claim: he was a strength path Immortal Venerable, founder of the strength path and also of transformation path.",
      "chapters": [
        686
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reckless-savage-founder",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_li_shan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On a northern plains icy plain that Reckless Savage repaired by turning into an immemorial ice phoenix and breathing profound ice, that ice phoenix transformation is itself a transformation path killer move. As creator of the icy plain he imprinted the true meaning of strength path and transformation path into that heaven and earth. A circulating rumor holds that a strength path or transformation path Gu Master who ascends to Gu Immortal there can resonate with dao fragments and evoke that true meaning. Icefall divine ape and ancient pegasi appearing as earthly calamities are those true meanings in external form; shattering them lets the contained true meaning enter the body as comprehension of heaven and earth.",
      "chapters": [
        686
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "icy-plain-true-meaning",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
